[[0,1324241,0,1,2,-1,"2016-10-04T01:00:53","Dumptruck","",[],"<p>This is how it went...</p>\n<p>&quot;We've both been redpilled</p>\n<p>We can't go back</p>\n<p>Fuck it Drea,...</p>\n<p>Seize the day....</p>\n<p>Draw a line in the sand and declare on this day....</p>\n<p>That <strong>NO, we will not go quietly into the dark</strong>....</p>\n<p>We will no longer accept the safe spaces, and trigger warnings, and multiple genders...</p>\n<p>Nor the domestic terror movements such as Black Lives matter, and their immature a socially incompatible followers....</p>\n<p>That today you declare with whole-hearted voice and a fist in the air...</p>\n<p>That you have been <strong>REDPILLED</strong>, and will no longer accept the grim future of political correctness</p>\n<p>There you go that's my speech. You may now return to your regularly scheduled programming&quot;</p>\n<p>And she was happy to hear it. She has embraced the Redpill. She has embraced voat. All for one, and one for all.</p>","A rally call against the modern day as told to a friend, from me.... \"Taking the RedPill\" by Dumptruck","","whatever"]]
